A death metal band Evthanazia was founded in small town Retchitsa, Belarus in 1992. In 2005 band name upgrated to Evthanazia A.D. and under this monicker released album "The Hate Exhumation" on CD via [l175906] (Release party @ MassaBrutto Fest-IX on March 30, 2008). Since 2015 band name returned back to [a2409852].
Full discography under name Evthanazia:
